{"id":"word:hebrew:H2543","type":"word","title":"חֲמוֹר","subtitle":"H2543 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a male ass (from its dun red )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֲמוֹר (H2543) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 96 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֲמוֹר (chămôwr) means a male ass (from its dun red ) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֲמוֹר","transliteration":"chămôwr","pronunciation":"kham-ore'","strong":"H2543","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2543","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/חֲמ֔וֹר","הַ/חֲמ֑וֹר","חֲמֹר֔/וֹ","חֲמ֨וֹר","חֲמ֖וֹר"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncbsa",18],["HNcbsa",14],["HC/Ncbpa",8],["HNcbpa",7],["HC/Ncbsa",6],["HTd/Ncbpa",6],["HNcbsc/Sp3ms",5],["HC/Td/Ncbsa",4],["HNcbsc",4],["HRd/Ncbpa",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"a male ass (from its dun red )","usage":"(he) ass.","full":"H2543. chamor I. חֲמוֺר noun [masculine] heap , absolute ׳ח with dual חֲמֹרָתָ֑יִם (Baer ׳חְִמֹרֹת ), as if from חֲמֹרָה ; — חֲמֹרָתָ֑יִם חֲמוֺר הַחֲמוֺר בִּלְחִי Judg 15:16 with the ass's jawbone, a heap, two heaps , i.e. so many slain. חֲמֹרֹתָ֑יִם see I. חֲמוֺר . above II. חֲמוֺר noun masculine Gen 45:23 (he)-ass (Late Hebrew id. (sometimes female, but this regularly חֲמוֺרָה ); Aramaic הֲמָרָא Arabic , Palmyrene חמרא Reckend ZMG 1888, 404 ; as imêru , Schr Cot Gloss ; — name from reddish colour) — absolute חֲמוֺר 22:5 43t.; חֲמֹר Exod 13:13 ; Deut 22:10 ; construct חֲמוֺר Exod 23:5 4 t.; הֲמֹר Gen 49:14 ; suffix חֲמֹרְךָ Deut 5:14 ; 28:31 ; חֲמֹרֶ֑ךָ Exod 23:12 ; חֲמֹרוֺ Gen 22:3 8 t.; plural חֲמוֺרִים Judg 19:10 9 t.; חֲמֹרִים Gen 12:16 16 t.; suffix חֲמוֺרֵינוּ Judg 19:19 ; חֲמֹרֵינוּ Gen 43:18 ; חֲמוֺרֵיכֶם 1Sam 8:16 ; חֲמֹרֵיהֶם Gen 34:28 4 t.; חֲמוֺרֵיהֶם Josh 9:4 ; &#8212; ass (he-ass ; אתון = she-ass ) found in all periods (collective only Gen 32:6 ; Isa 21:7 ); &#8212; 1 as (valuable) property, with oxen, sheep, camels, slaves, etc. Gen 12:16 ; 24:35 ; Genesis 30:48; 47:17 ; Exod 9:3 (all J) 20:17 (E), 21:33 ; 22:8 (twice in verse); 22:9 ; 23:4-5 , 12 ; Num 16:15 ; Josh 6:21 ; 7:24 (all J E); note also Exod 13:13 = 34:20 (J E; firstlings belong to ׳י ); Gen 36:24 ; Num 31:28 , 30 , 34 , 39 , 45 (all P); Deut 5:14 , 18 ; 22:3-4 , Judg 6:4 ; 1Sam 8:16 ; 12:3 ; 15:3 ; 22:19 ; 27:9 ; 1Chr 5:21 ; Ezra 2:67 = Neh 7:68 (Baer), Zech 14:15 ; collective Gen 32:5 (J; || שׁוֺר ), שִׁפְחָה עֶבֶד, צאֹן, , but plural (similar ||) 34:28 (P), 47:17 (J); compare also ׳ח יְתוֺמִים Job 24:3 the orphans' ass (|| אַלְמָנָה שׁוֺר ); as knowing its master's crib Isa 1:3 (|| שׁוֺר ); found in camp 2Kin 7:7 , 10 (both || סוּסִים ); as harnessed לַה ׳מֶתֶג Prov 26:3 (|| סוּס ). 2 used for riding : a. by women Exod 4:20 (J), Josh 15:18 (JE) = Judg 1:14 ; 1Sam 25:20 , 23 , 42 , compare 2Chr 28:15 . b. by men 2Sam 16:2 ; 17:23 ; 19:27 ; 1Kin 2:40 ; 13:13 (twice in verse); 13:23-24 , 27 , 28 (twice in verse); Isa 21:7 ; Zech 9:9 . c. חמורים צֶמֶד a pair of asses 2Sam 16:1 (for burdens and for riding); for man and woman Judg 19:3 , 10 , 19 , 21 ; carrying dead body 19:28 , compare ׳ח 1Kin 13:29 . 3 beast of burden Gen 22:3 , 5 (compare 22:6 ), 42:26-27 , 45:23 (all E) 43:18 , 24 ; 44:3 , 13 (all J), Josh 9:4 (JE), 1Sam 25:18 ; 1 Chronicles 12:41; Neh 13:15 (compare also ח ׳צֶמֶד 2Sam 16:1 above); metaphor of Issachar ׳ח נָּ֑רֶם Gen 49:14 (poem), an ass of (strong) bones. — ׳ח לֶחֶם 1Sam 16:20 read probably חֲמִשָּׁה five , or better עֲשָׂרָה ten , see We Dr. 4 used in tillage Isa 32:20 ; not to be used in ploughing with an ox ( שׁוֺר ) Deut 22:10 . 5 parts of body of ass mentioned are : ח ׳לְחִי Judg 15:15-16 , jawbone, Samson's weapon; ח ׳ראֹשׁ 2Kin 6:25 eaten in famine; ה ׳בְּשַׂר Ezek 23:20 Genital organ of ass (contemptuous simile) 6 ה ׳קְבוּרַת Jer 22:19 burial of an ass , in figure of ignominious treatment of a corpse.","rootNote":"or (shortened) חֲמֹר ; from 2560 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 21","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 21","1Chr 12 41","1Kgs 2 40","1Kgs 13 13","1Kgs 13 13","1Kgs 13 23","1Kgs 13 24","1Kgs 13 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":96,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמוֹרִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/חֲמוֹרִ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 40","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמֹר֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמ֑וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמ֔וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמ֔וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/חֲמוֹר֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 27","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמ֑וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַֽ/חֲמוֹר֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמֽוֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֲמ֖וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 8 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":8,"verse":16